\par\par \b \uc2 Turkey seeks relief with  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  swap deal by year-end -sources\b0\par\par\uc2 461 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Dezember 2021\par 11:08\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 ANKARA, Dec 23 (Reuters) - Talks between \uc2 Turkey's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and counterparts in Azerbaijan and the UAE on securing a possible \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap line are wrapping up and one deal is likely before year-end, two officials with knowledge of the matter told Reuters.\par \par \uc2 Turkey is in need of such foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to provide a buffer against a fast-moving lira crash and inflationary spiral, and to bolster the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's depleted reserves after its expensive market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  - which has sought foreign swap lines in the last two years with some success - declined to comment on the state of talks with Azerbaijan and the United Arab Emirates.\par \par \uc2 The Azeri and Emirati central banks did not immediately respond to requests for comment on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 In June Reuters reported, citing sources, that the \uc2 Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was close to securing a deal with Azerbaijan, which is among Ankara's closest allies.\par \par \uc2 The size of any potential swap line was unclear. No final agreement had been reached, said the sources, who requested anonymity.\par \par \uc2 "A deal with Azerbaijan is almost complete. Swap agreements will contribute positively in this period (and) talks with several countries continue," a senior Turkish official said.\par \par \uc2 The second source said that the initial amount of the swap deal with Azerbaijan could be small but gradually rise.\par \par \uc2 "Talks with the UAE are also at an advanced stage ... The possibility for one of these to be signed before year-end is very high," the person said.\par \par \uc2 Turkey and the UAE have taken recent steps to ease badly strained ties in the wake of the 2011 Arab Spring uprisings, primarily over the role of Islamist groups in the tumult. The countries were also on opposite sides of the conflict in Libya.\par \par \uc2 Last month, Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor \uc2 Sahap Kavcioglu\uc2  met UAE officials in Ankara for preliminary talks on a potential swap agreement and they agreed to improve cooperation.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has swap deals with China, Qatar and South Korea worth about $23 billion. They encourage trade in local \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and boost the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gross reserves.\par \par \uc2 In an attempt to slow a historic crash in the lira, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has announced five direct market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  this month that bankers say totalled as much as $10 billion. The lira rebounded sharply this week from record lows.\par \par \uc2 Turkey had also previously sought deals with central banks in the United States, Britain, Russia and Malaysia, Reuters has reported. The \uc2 Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reserves remain depleted after a series of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2019-2020 in which some $128 billion was sold via state banks.\par \par \uc2 (Editing by Jonathan Spicer and Catherine Evans) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2021-12-23T11:08:38.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020211223ehcn00zsx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
