 ; Shareholder Support Rating; New Rating; b+\par \par \uc2 ----senior unsecured; Long Term Rating; Affirmed; B+\par \par \uc2 ----subordinated; Long Term Rating; Affirmed; B\par \par \uc2 ----senior unsecured; Long Term Rating; Affirmed; B+\par \par \uc2 ----senior unsecured; Short Term Rating; Affirmed; B\par \par \uc2 Vakif Katilim Bankasi AS; Long Term Issuer Default Rating; Affirmed; B; Rating Outlook Negative\par \par \uc2 ; Short Term Issuer Default Rating; Affirmed; B\par \par \uc2 ; Local \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Long Term Issuer Default Rating; Affirmed; BB-; Rating Outlook Negative\par \par \uc2 ; Local \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Short Term Issuer Default Rating; Affirmed; B\par \par \uc2 ; National Long Term Rating; Affirmed; AA(tur); Rating Outlook Stable\par \par \uc2 ; Support Rating; Withdrawn; WD\par \par \uc2 ; Support Rating Floor; Withdrawn; WD\par \par \uc2 ; Government Support Rating; New Rating; b\par \par \uc2 QNB Finansbank A.S.; Long Term Issuer Default Rating; Affirmed; B+; Rating Outlook Negative\par \par \uc2 ; Short Term Issuer Default Rating; Affirmed; B\par \par \uc2 ; Local \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Long Term Issuer Default Rating; Affirmed; BB-; Rating Outlook Negative\par \par \uc2 ; Local \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Short Term Issuer Default Rating; Affirmed; B\par \par \uc2 ; National Long Term Rating; Affirmed; AA(tur); Rating Outlook Stable\par \par \uc2 ; Support Rating; Withdrawn; WD\par \par \uc2 ; Shareholder Support Rating; New Rating; b+\par \par \uc2 ----senior unsecured; Long Term Rating; Affirmed; B+\par \par \uc2 ----senior unsecured; Short Term Rating; Affirmed; B\par \par \uc2 ING Bank A.S.; Long Term Issuer Default Rating; Affirmed; B+; Rating Outlook Negative\par \par \uc2 ; Short Term Issuer Default Rating; Affirmed; B\par \par \uc2 ; Local \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Long Term Issuer Default Rating; Affirmed